From: premohq <48417750+premohq@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 23:55:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] PS5-ECAM's Switch side: never ProsperoEden's launcher, which
 its app does not carry

PS5-ECAM packages none of ProsperoEden's launcher (its ui/ art, fonts, sounds and translations): its own
loading screen and in-game menu draw with PS5-ECAM's fonts and strings. A start without PS5-ECAM's
launch request, or with a game it could not find, went to ProsperoEden's launcher, which without its
font shows a red screen and quits to the home screen. It goes back to PS5-ECAM instead, with the reason
in the result file PS5-ECAM shows.
---
 headless/main.cpp | 11 +++++++++++
 1 file changed, 11 insertions(+)

diff --git a/headless/main.cpp b/headless/main.cpp
index bd24b25..4295cd5 100644
--- a/headless/main.cpp
+++ b/headless/main.cpp
@@ -820,6 +820,17 @@ int main(int argc, char** argv) {
 #endif
             return 0;
         } else {
+#ifdef EDEN_ECAM
+        // PS5-ECAM carries none of ProsperoEden's launcher (no ui/ in its app): started without PS5-ECAM's
+        // request (or with a game it could not find), this program goes back to PS5-ECAM, which says why,
+        // rather than to a launcher it does not have
+        {
+            const std::string why = !launch_error.empty() ? launch_error : std::string{"The Switch side was started without a game"};
+            Eden::Report("exit", ("Back to PS5-ECAM: " + why).c_str());
+            ps5ingamenx::WriteResult("failed", why);
+            return 0;
+        }
+#endif
         guest_fault_retries = 0;
         forwarded_session = false;
 #if defined(EDEN_DEV_PROFILE) || defined(EDEN_DEV_ROM_ID)
